# Honored Knight-Captain: "When this creature enters, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token" and "{4}{W}{W},
# Sacrifice this creature: Search your library for an Equipment card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle." Turn 1: cast
# with Plains and Mox Pearl, the token arrives. Turn 3: Plains, Mox Pearl and Black Lotus (three blue) make only five mana, so
# the ability is refused; the Island makes six with {W}{W} and the pool is empty after paying. Only an Equipment card may be
